    "q-22530": {
      "dom_id": "step-q22530",
      "name": "Question 3",
      "problem": "$\\frac{2}{3}{(\\frac{3}{v})}^{2}{(\\frac{1}{u})}^{3}=$",
      "worked_solution": "We apply the power of quotient rule and simplify:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{2}{3}{(\\frac{3}{v})}^{2}{(\\frac{1}{u})}^{3} & = \\\\ \\frac{2}{3}\\cdot \\frac{{3}^{2}}{{v}^{2}}\\cdot \\frac{{1}^{3}}{{u}^{3}} & = \\\\ \\frac{2}{3}\\cdot \\frac{9}{{v}^{2}}\\cdot \\frac{1}{{u}^{3}} & = \\\\ \\frac{18}{3{v}^{2}{u}^{3}} & = \\\\ \\frac{6}{{v}^{2}{u}^{3}}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
